<title>JAPAN: Denso bid-only on share repurchase report.</title>
<headline>Denso bid-only on share repurchase report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denso Corp shares were bid-only in Tuesday morning trade on media reports that the firm was planning a share repurchase, brokers said.</p>
<p>Denso officials declined to comment on the report.</p>
<p>As of 0123 GMT, the shares of the Toyota group firm were bid-only at 3,050 yen, after closing at 2,880 yen on Friday.</p>
<p>Japanese markets were closed on Monday for a national holiday.</p>
</text>
